The independent NumPy check matches the primary model final grid RMSE and fixed-basis prediction gap within1e-7. Float64 reduction ordering affects late finite-budget Adam iterates; the width-sweep RMSE comparison uses an explicit5e-4 absolute tolerance. The receipt retains the actual comparison values and tolerances.
